WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.144
Raj: A long-running transaction remains on October. It belongs to the reporting job.
十月分区仍有一个长事务，属于报表任务。

2
00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:13.032
Hannah: Then preflight isn't clear just yet. Ask its owner before any cancellation.
那预检还没通过，取消前必须问负责人。

3
00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:19.632
Priya: Okay, pause our go/no-go decision here. The off-peak window isn't permission itself.
好，先暂停继续与否的决策，低峰窗口本身不是执行许可。

4
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:25.392
Anika: I'm on it with that owner. About three minutes remain, they estimate.
我联系负责人，他们估计还要三分钟左右。

5
00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:31.176
Lukas: Don't kill it just for convenience. A lock wait could outlast expectations.
别只为省事杀掉事务，锁等待也可能比预计长。

6
00:00:31.176 --> 00:00:38.160
Raj: Storage covers index and temporary build space. No other schema changes are scheduled.
存储余量覆盖索引和构建临时空间，没有其他结构变更安排。

7
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:46.680
Hannah: Verify privileges and exact leaf table. Also confirm we're outside a transaction block.
验证权限和准确叶表，也确认不是在事务块中。

8
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:53.376
Priya: Just to confirm, wait for completion, right? Then rerun the transaction age check.
确认一下，等它完成，对吧？之后再检查事务年龄。

9
00:00:53.376 --> 00:01:00.552
Lukas: The owner now reports successful completion. Database activity confirms no old transaction.
负责人现在报告完成成功，数据库活动也确认没有旧事务。

10
00:01:00.552 --> 00:01:06.960
Raj: So, the repeated preflight checks pass. I'll start only the approved partition.
那重新预检通过，我只开始批准的分区。

